    <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Management Development Program</cbc:Name>
    
    <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">The Norwegian Environment Agency would like to strengthen our 60 managers, both individually and as a team. We want a comprehensive management development programme that helps our managers manage requirements and expectations and to exercise good management in line with management expectations in good leadership in the Norwegian Environment Agency, the government's employer strategy and other needs among us. 

We need assistance with planning and implementing an overall management development programme in the Norwegian Environment Agency. The programme shall last for a period of four years, starting autumn 2026. Tenderers must be available for planning and development work from spring 2026, including carrying out a kick-off during a planned management gathering in May 2026. The contract period is from 21 April 2026 to 30 June 2030.</cbc:Description>
